items.body:
A brief morning pop in technology stocks evaporated Tuesday, leaving chip names and leveraged ETFs deep in the red as sellers reasserted control and snuffed out any hope of a sustained recovery.&nbsp;



The intraday pattern was unmistakable — an early bounce, a rejection at resistance and a hard fade that accelerated into midday.




AMD stock is sinking. See the chart and price action here.&nbsp

